{"name": "Coco's Revenge", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>JUMP, PHASE &amp; ROTATE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"390\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/56d02ef16dd0015bb05325db617bac75.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/56d02ef16dd0015bb05325db617bac75.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/56d02ef16dd0015bb05325db617bac75.mp4?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>About</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"292\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/7b40f3aa49397326913bf0a252be0b16.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/7b40f3aa49397326913bf0a252be0b16.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/7b40f3aa49397326913bf0a252be0b16.mp4?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The sky has been stolen, and only you as one of three physics breaking bunnies, can bring it back. <br/><br/>In Coco's Revenge, you\u2019ll hop, phase, and rotate your way through a retro 2D precision platformer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Shift between positive and negative space, and rotate entire stages with the help of your fairy friend to set the fastest stage times possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on tough challenges and stare down bosses, all in the name of saving the sky.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><u><strong>Features</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"292\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/db0fe6352b3ae310f52605c2522c32e0.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/db0fe6352b3ae310f52605c2522c32e0.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/db0fe6352b3ae310f52605c2522c32e0.mp4?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">120+ stages, including <i>Secret Stages</i> and <i>Challenges</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">6 Biomes and Boss Battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A soundtrack featuring acoustic melodies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic gameplay mechanics involving spatial awareness</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3 Playable Characters</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Wishlist </strong><i>Coco's Revenge</i><strong> Now!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"292\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/efec51c862f2e5b12ddbee4ee252f044.poster.avif?t=1787966615\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/efec51c862f2e5b12ddbee4ee252f044.webm?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/extras/efec51c862f2e5b12ddbee4ee252f044.mp4?t=1787966615\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Hop, jump, phase and rotate the world in one of the strangest award winning 2D platformers you've ever seen. Find secrets and set record times accompanied by a live acoustic soundtrack with a dash of seriously quirky visuals. All in the name of saving the sky from the evil Dr. Wily Fox.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3350850/ab0ce355c4ea798096e8a39561ded234b842d0ea/header.jpg?t=1787966615", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Precision Platformer", "2D Platformer", "Difficult", "Retro", "1990's", "Platformer"], "developers": "Octopus Punch", "publishers": "Octopus Punch", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3350850", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "16 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/HAZasr0GNQA", "first_seen": 1773619200.0, "review_rank": 961}